msgid ""
"This guide shows how to use the Dice solver as an alternative SCI solver to "
"diagonalize larger Fermionic problems beyond what the default PySCF solver "
"can support. For information on how to install and use ``qiskit-addon-dice-"
"solver``, [visit the documentation](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-"
"dice-solver/). For more details on the SQD code used in this example, see "
"the [chemistry Hamiltonian tutorial](/tutorials/sample-based-quantum-"
"diagonalization).\n"
msgstr ""
